      "post": {
        "summary": "购物车提交订购",
        "description": "购物车提交订购接口。\ncurl调用示例:\n```\ncurl -i -k -H 'Accept:application/json' -H \"X-Auth-Token:xxx\" -H 'Content-Type:application/json;charset=utf8' -X POST -d'{json}'  https://accessip:port/rest/shoppingcart/v3.0/subscriptions\n```",
        "x-precautions": "1.header中需要携带token, x-auth-token。\n2.错误码:当请求不成功时,响应体内的错误码信息请参见“ManageOne 运营面API参考 > 错误码说明 > 订单管理”章节。\n",
        "x-opseverity": "Minor",
        "tags": [
          "订单管理"
        ],
        "x-resource": "购物车管理",
        "operationId": "CommitSubscriptions",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-language",
            "in": "header",
            "type": "string",
            "description": "语言类型:中文zh-cn、英文en-us。"
          },
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "操作用户token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "shoppingCartReq",
